  <title>W01 Quiz: WhatsApp </title>
  <description>&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;: Get set up with the group you will be working with throughout the course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Task&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Set up WhatsApp, join your WhatsApp group, and introduce yourself to your group in WhatsApp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Background&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You will be put into two WhatsApp groups. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="list-style-type: decimal;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;One group is for the instructor to communicate with the class to post announcements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;The other group is for you to work with your classmates on assignments. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Remember these groups, and the information in these groups (including WhatsApp contact information) is only to be used for class purposes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Instructions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Download WhatsApp (if you do not already have it downloaded).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Additional resources from the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/whatsapp-messenger/id310633997" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Apple App Store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="external_link_icon" role="presentation"&gt;&lt;span class="screenreader-only"&gt;Links to an external site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://www.whatsapp.com/android/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Android Download page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="external_link_icon" role="presentation"&gt;&lt;span class="screenreader-only"&gt;Links to an external site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://www.whatsapp.com/download/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PC/MAC Desktop Download page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="external_link_icon" role="presentation"&gt;&lt;span class="screenreader-only"&gt;Links to an external site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use &lt;/strong&gt;the link provided by your instructor, in a message on Day 1 (Monday), to join your WhatsApp group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;In WhatsApp: &lt;strong&gt;P&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ost&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;'hi' to your group in WhatsApp after joining your WhatsApp group group&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(You will only see comments after you post. You will see nothing before your post.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;If you need to report a WhatsApp Issue, please use this&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="external" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdyVuJRjdnYckoZyoYmhBVXJD36yFzfhdxQu875EQfZhM4dyQ/viewform" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span&gt;form.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="external_link_icon" role="presentation"&gt;&lt;span class="screenreader-only"&gt;Links to an external site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
